config FREETZ_PACKAGE_TUYA_IOT_CORE_SDK
	bool "tuya-iot-core-sdk (Tuya IoT Core SDK for C)"
	depends on FREETZ_TARGET_UCLIBC_1_0_58_MIN
	default n
	help
		Tuya IoT Core SDK for C: MQTT/TLS connection of a device to the
		Tuya Cloud, including the data model, OTA and sub-device APIs.
		mbedTLS, coreMQTT, coreHTTP and coreJSON are bundled.

		The upstream example programs are built and installed; they get
		their device credentials from the environment (the upstream
		values are only placeholders):

		 TUYA_PRODUCT_ID=... TUYA_DEVICE_ID=... TUYA_DEVICE_SECRET=... \
			/mnt/data/tuya/usr/bin/data_model_basic_demo

		TUYA_MQTT_HOST can be set to select another data centre
		(default: m1.tuyacn.com).

		Installs:
		 - /usr/bin/custom_protocol_basic_demo
		 - /usr/bin/data_model_basic_demo
		 - /usr/bin/ota_basic_demo
		 - /usr/bin/subdevice_basic_demo

		Requires uClibc 1.0.58 or newer.

		https://github.com/tuya/tuya-iot-core-sdk
